description_text:
This is model is shared for free. More models you can find and download on the link below: 

https://www.cgtrader.com/designinme 

The following formats of this model are available:

  - .blend (as native);

  - .obj;

  - .stl;

  - .fbx;

  - .mtl;

  - .glb;

  - .dae;

The model has got 6890 vertices and 4134 faces. 
The original minecraft textures (256x256 resolution .png format) were used for creating materials. 
Cycles  was used for creating render images.

Low poly assets pack, ready for games.
Models:6 Trees;3  Rocks;5 Grass;2 Stumps;1 Log;
